.TH QUIPU-SEARCH-INDEX-BACKFILL 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-search\-index\-backfill \- Backfill a search index in batches
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu search\-index backfill\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-kind\fR] [\fB\-\-batch\-size\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Backfill a search index in batches
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-kind\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-batch\-size\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
